### Signup (register new user)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "email": "testuser1@example.com"
}

### Login (get JWT)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Add a book (replace <token> with JWT)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Book Title 1",
  "author": "Author 1"
}

### List books (replace <token> with JWT)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Update a book (replace <token> and <bookId>)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/books/<bookId>
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Book Title"
}

### Delete a book (replace <token> and <bookId>)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/books/<bookId>
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Bulk insert books (replace <token> with JWT)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/books/bulk
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "books": [
    { "title": "Bulk Book 1", "author": "Bulk Author 1" },
    { "title": "Bulk Book 2", "author": "Bulk Author 2" }
  ]
}
